/* Help */
"Help" = "说明";
"Tap a card to pick it. Tap it again to put it back." = "点一下选牌，再点一下取消。";
"Double-tap takes the pair or three of that rank, or the whole suit when you hold five or more of it." = "点两下选出该点数的对子或三条；同一花色有五张或以上就全选。";
"Hold a card to take every card of that rank." = "按住一张牌，选出该点数的全部。";
"Lead and Play send the cards you picked. Pass stays out. You cannot pass a lead. The empty box clears the pick." = "出牌打出选中的牌。过就不出。先出时不能过。空格取消选择。";
"The sort button shows ♠ or 2: that is the order a tap switches to." = "排序按钮显示 ♠ 或 2，那是点一下之后的排法。";
"The player with the 3♦ leads the first deal. Match the play on the table with a higher one, or pass." = "持有 3♦ 的人先出第一局。要出更大的牌，或者过。";
"Two or three of a kind: higher rank wins, then the highest suit among them." = "对子或三条：点数大的赢，再比其中最大的花色。";
"Five cards, from low to high: straight, flush, full house, four of a kind, straight flush." = "五张由小到大：顺子、同花、葫芦、四条、同花顺。";
"A straight runs A2345, then 23456, up to TJQKA. JQKA2 is not a straight." = "顺子由 A2345、23456 排到 TJQKA。JQKA2 不是顺子。";
"A straight is ranked by its highest card, then that card's suit. In A2345 the high card is the 5." = "顺子比最大的那张，再比它的花色。A2345 的最大牌是 5。";
"A flush is ranked by its highest card, then that card's suit. A full house by the three of a kind. Four of a kind by the four." = "同花比最大的一张，再比它的花色。葫芦比三条。四条比那四张。";
"Each card left costs its rank: 3 is 1, up to 2 which is 13. Ten or more cards left doubles the cost. The winner takes all three totals." = "剩牌按点数计：3 是 1，直到 2 是 13。剩十张或以上加倍。胜者取三家的总和。";
"A game is ten deals." = "一盘打十局。";
"With Hong Kong rules, from the next deal: the last winner leads, and 23456 is the highest straight." = "港式规则从下一局起：上一局胜者先出，23456 是最大的顺子。";
"Enter your name. The dark row is you. Leave a row blank to keep its name." = "输入你的名字。深色那行是你。留空就用原来的名字。";
